alty cruel and unusual? blood atonement evolving standards of decency mitigating evidence majestic generalities\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-15-throughline-最高法院说死刑-像被闪电击中般随机-全国叫停-四年后又恢复/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/52f805d49b676f98-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">47:51</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Throughline</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1015</span></div>\n<h2>最高法院說死刑「像被閃電擊中般隨機」，全國叫停，四年後又恢復</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">「殘忍與非常」四個字從未被制憲者定義清楚，最高法院靠「社會成熟過程中不斷演進的道德標準」反覆重寫它的邊界，死刑因此被全國廢除，又在四年內捲土重來。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">死刑</span><span class=\"tag\">第八修正案</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Viking Origins: The Nordic Iron Age Pre-Roman Iron Age Migration Period Vendel Period bog bodies wandering settlements\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-15-ancients-维京时代只是尾声-北欧铁器时代的一千五百年被严重低估/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/90576ce4c40955d2-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:07:38</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">The Ancients</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1015</span></div>\n<h2>維京時代只是尾聲：北歐鐵器時代的一千五百年被嚴重低估</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">維京時代常被當作北歐歷史的起點，但研究者認為它其實是一千五百年鐵器時代演化到壓力頂點的產物，而不是憑空出現的輝煌開端。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">維京時代</span><span class=\"tag\">鐵器時代</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"The History of the Illuminati Streisand effect Protocols of the Elders of Zion Jacobins Federalists\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-15-historyhit-光明会真实存在但一事无成-查禁它的政府成就了阴谋论神话/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/604115789971ea93-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"D\"><span class=\"dur\">45:13</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">History Hit</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1015</span></div>\n<h2>光明會真實存在但一事無成：查禁它的政府成就了陰謀論神話</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">巴伐利亞政府查禁光明會並公開全部繳獲文件後，這個內訌不斷、一事無成的讀書會反而成了兩百年來陰謀論的萬能模板。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">陰謀論</span><span class=\"tag\">啟蒙運動</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Elizabeth Holmes&#x27; Husband Billy Evans: The Trial, Prison &amp; Nathan Fielder&#x27;s Documentary First Step Act Raman spectroscopy BOP\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-15-allin-霍姆斯丈夫-她最大的错不是欺诈-是守口如瓶三年/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c91d628233831dd0-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">41:55</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">All-In</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1015</span></div>\n<h2>霍姆斯丈夫：她最大的錯不是欺詐，是守口如瓶三年</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">比利·埃文斯說，法官只要求「在法庭上打這場官司，不在媒體上打」,霍姆斯就守規矩守到全程對媒體一字不提；他認為這才是她犯下的最大錯誤，因為她的力量本來就在於講述自己的故事。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">Theranos</span><span class=\"tag\">聯邦訴訟</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"184: 與陳哲的「具身季報26Q3」：Astra衝擊後，通用模型會吃掉Robotics嗎？ In-Context Learning (ICL) Physical RSI VLA World Action Model (WAM) Robot Dojo FCC\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-15-latetalk-gpt-6-astra能自己设计机器人实验-让ai训练ai/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/cca2d003691224c6-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"晚\"><span class=\"dur\">1:46:24</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">晚點聊</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1015</span></div>\n<h2>GPT-6 Astra能自己設計機器人實驗，讓AI訓練AI</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">當通用語言模型可以直接在仿真環境裡調試、訓練自己的機器人策略時，獨立具身模型公司「物理AI大於數字AI」的估值敘事就開始鬆動。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">具身智能</span><span class=\"tag\">通用大模型</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"154. 對Dyna創始人Lindon的3小時訪談：機器人世界的迷霧、分歧與抉擇，修心、《沉思錄》與王陽明 product research egocentric data Scaling Law\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-15-zhangxiaojun-机器人不是因为太慢而停工-而是因为没人给它续料/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/d72b9689652bb19b-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">2:51:18</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1015</span></div>\n<h2>機器人不是因為太慢而停工，而是因為沒人給它續料</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">疊餐巾機器人已做到99%成功率和商業化客戶，Dyna卻主動叫停規模化——因為完成單個任務不等於接管一套工作流，機器人離不開人類隨時續料的保姆式照看。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">具身智能</span><span class=\"tag\">機器人創業</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"714. King Arthur: Lancelot and the Round Table (Part 2) courtly love chevalier couched lance destrier Siege Perilous knight errant\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-14-restishistory-写下骑士精神圣经的马洛里-法庭记录显示他被控强奸/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/e0e239fd8a480758-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:06:48</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">The Rest Is History</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1014</span></div>\n<h2>寫下騎士精神聖經的馬洛裡，法庭記錄顯示他被控強姦</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">《亞瑟王之死》作者馬洛裡的法庭記錄列出伏擊謀殺、搶劫、入室強姦等罪名，卻是他寫下了騎士精神最深情的頌詞。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">亞瑟王傳說</span><span class=\"tag\">騎士制度</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"404. Norman Conquest: Colonising Ireland (Part 4) Atheling March of Wales Burgh First English Empire\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-14-empirehist-同是凯尔特边疆-苏格兰靠联姻自保-威尔士爱尔兰被各个击破/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/6dcfd4bf69c91d0f-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"E\"><span class=\"dur\">49:03</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Empire 世界史</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1014</span></div>\n<h2>同是凱爾特邊疆，蘇格蘭靠聯姻自保，威爾士愛爾蘭被各個擊破</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">諾曼人只跟有一個王室可談的政權聯姻通婚，蘇格蘭因此保住自治；威爾士、愛爾蘭是幾十個互相攻伐的小邦，沒有談判對象，只能被逐一武力吞併。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">諾曼征服</span><span class=\"tag\">蘇格蘭史</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"She Built Facebook&#x27;s First Assistant. Now She&#x27;s Betting Against Full Autonomy | Shivani Poddar, Wajo subtask delegation human in the loop\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-14-solofounders-全自主ai会卡壳-她押注的是能随时喊人来救场的助理/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/05e9ab3eba6a7788-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">58:06</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">單人創始人</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1014</span></div>\n<h2>全自主AI會卡殼：她押注的是能隨時喊人來救場的助理</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">AI獨自上場常常卡殼，Foe創始人押注的是AI卡住時真人專家隨時接手的半自動模式，而不是追求純粹的全自主。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">個人AI助理</span><span class=\"tag\">人機協作</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Lab-in-the-Loop at Compute Speed — Ian Quigley, Leash Bio DEL (DNA-Encoded Library) SMILES Clever Hans effect activity cliff cross-attention ADMET\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-14-latentspace-模型能认出分子出自哪位化学家-学到的是风格不是化学/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/eb2bbc1745d15c63-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"L\"><span class=\"dur\">1:49:56</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Latent Space</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1014</span></div>\n<h2>模型能認出分子出自哪位化學家，學到的是風格不是化學</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">給1815位化學家的分子做分類，模型靠作者風格就能猜中六成，卻學不到真實結合物理——這正是Leash堅持只用自產DEL數據訓練模型的原因。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">藥物發現</span><span class=\"tag\">機器學習</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"At The Money: Is Technology Price Gouging Consumers? Surveillance pricing Dynamic pricing Revenue management system Electronic shelf labels Agentic commerce\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-14-mastersinbiz-同一超市同一秒-你的鸡蛋可能比别人贵23/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/bea6fad9d38a1e43-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"M\"><span class=\"dur\">25:43</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Masters in Business</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1014</span></div>\n<h2>同一超市同一秒，你的雞蛋可能比別人貴23%</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">算法讓「比價能壓住漲價」這個老機制失靈了：RealPage的軟件讓上千房東不用見面就統一調價，Instacart則按顧客身份對同款商品悄悄開出不同價格。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">價格歧視</span><span class=\"tag\">算法合謀</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Eponymous Foods: Full Bars eponymous food malted milk buttercream candy\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-14-stuffmissed-m-m-s的另一个m-其实是对手hershey总裁儿子的姓氏/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/88586eb98e196b1a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">38:10</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Stuff You Missed in History Class</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1014</span></div>\n<h2>M&amp;M&#x27;s的另一個M,其實是對手Hershey總裁兒子的姓氏</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Forrest Mars在西班牙內戰時見士兵靠糖衣巧克力豆防融化，回美國找來對手Hershey總裁的兒子合夥，把這個靈感做成了M&amp;M&#x27;s。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">糖果史</span><span class=\"tag\">家族企業</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Can Open Models Keep Up With the AI Frontier? | Nathan Lambert RSI (Recursive Self-Improvement) distillation RL environment reward hacking harness\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-14-a16z-中国ai实验室不缺人才-差的是人均5000张h100算力/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">59:54</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1014</span></div>\n<h2>中國AI實驗室不缺人才，差的是人均5000張H100算力</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Nathan Lambert說中國實驗室技術人才並不遜色，真正的鴻溝是普通研究員能調用的算力——OpenAI一人就有約5000張H100量級的資源，蒸餾頂多幫他們省下幾個月。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">開源模型</span><span class=\"tag\">蒸餾</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"S5E16丨投資的明線與暗線，其實都不容易 OW證\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-14-sandian-十年经济换挡-顶级字画没怎么跌-新锐藏品却可能亏掉九成/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/9c954cc7340de35e-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"三\"><span class=\"dur\">51:40</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">三點下班</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1014</span></div>\n<h2>十年經濟換擋，頂級字畫沒怎麼跌，新銳藏品卻可能虧掉九成</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">過去十年中國頂級資產整體滯漲，但八大山人精品冊從2300萬漲到6000多萬；供給能快速擴張的新銳藏品，買家卻可能虧掉九成——真正稀缺的供給才扛得住經濟換擋。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">消費分化</span><span class=\"tag\">服務消費</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Governing AI Agents: Alan Chan of GovAI on Monitoring, Agent IDs, Rogue Agents &amp; Preparing for RSI RSP (Responsible Scaling Policy) rogue agent chain of thought monitoring intelligence explosion / RSI embedded auditors distress button\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-14-cogrev-互联网没法分辨-ai-agent-和真人-身份标准还没人建起来/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ac48fcb47222924e-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">2:19:02</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Cognitive Revolution</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1014</span></div>\n<h2>互聯網沒法分辨 AI agent 和真人，身份標準還沒人建起來</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Alan Chan 說，基本沒有任何系統能把 AI agent 和人類賬號區分開——給整個互聯網統一身份標準，協調成本高到幾乎不可能跨過。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI治理</span><span class=\"tag\">agent身份</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Dyna-2: General Purpose Physical Agents with Hour-Long Autonomy — Jason Ma, Dyna Robotics World Action Model Diffusion Transformer Flow Matching VLA (Vision-Language-Action model) Eureka Distillation\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-13-latentspace-机器人不该只学动作-而要先学会预测整个世界/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/f4f5fa9a2cf9d198-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"L\"><span class=\"dur\">1:11:57</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Latent Space</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1013</span></div>\n<h2>機器人不該只學動作，而要先學會預測整個世界</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Dyna 的世界行動模型讓機器人先在想像裡生成未來視頻，再據此生成動作，創始人稱之為機器人版的思維鏈，也是它和 VLA 路線的根本分歧。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">機器人</span><span class=\"tag\">世界模型</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"David Deming on the Future of Universities in the Age of AI collegium barbell strategy blue book exam tenure track intellectual vitality\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-13-goodfight-哈佛学院院长说-ai时代大学卖的不是专家-是社群与德性/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c75b9a8ba0dff85c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">The Good Fight</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1013</span></div>\n<h2>哈佛學院院長說：AI時代大學賣的不是專家，是社群與德性</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">過去大學靠知識和專家身份收費，現在AI能替代專家本身的功能，大學能留住學生的只剩下共同體能教的品格與協作能力。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">高等教育</span><span class=\"tag\">AI與教學</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Can AI Break Cryptography? What the Experts Actually Think lattice-based cryptography cryptographic agility SNARK recursion P vs NP problem\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-13-a16z-ai若攻不破密码学假设-信心反而比十年验证更强/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">42:11</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1013</span></div>\n<h2>AI若攻不破密碼學假設，信心反而比十年驗證更強</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">一條「bunker模式」警告推文引發恐慌，但專家指出：目前沒有證據說明密碼學假設被削弱——真正的問題是AI實驗室從未公開是否試過用模型攻擊這些假設。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">密碼學</span><span class=\"tag\">人工智能安全</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"parent\" data-hay=\"Raising emotionally healthy boys: How to protect connection, vulnerability, and their authentic selves with Dr. Adam McCormick small-t therapy traumatic tension shoulder to shoulder\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-13-secureattach-男孩的愤怒和冷漠底下-常常是他们说不出名字的羞耻/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ddcbe6658f0e30d7-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">56:22</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"parent\"><span class=\"src\">Securely Attached</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1013</span></div>\n<h2>男孩的憤怒和冷漠底下，常常是他們說不出名字的羞恥</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">男孩外在的發怒、沉默或挑釁行為，常常不是情緒問題本身，而是神經系統為了保住依戀關係，本能切斷真實自我表達後留下的信號。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">男孩養育</span><span class=\"tag\">羞恥情緒</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"David Vélez - Building Nubank and the Future of Global Banking - [Invest Like the Best, EP.495] foundation model open banking / open finance stablecoin\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-13-ilt-chatgpt能重写你的产品-却拿不到银行牌照/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/2e1d3d395b96b48a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"I\"><span class=\"dur\">1:11:40</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Invest Like the Best</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1013</span></div>\n<h2>ChatGPT能重寫你的產品，卻拿不到銀行牌照</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Nubank創始人認為，這正是為什麼規模玩家反而最吃到AI紅利——他們已經攢下十幾年數據、拿到了牌照，AI只是放大優勢的槓桿，而非抹平優勢的推土機。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">金融科技</span><span class=\"tag\">AI應用</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Ep 224 Snake Oil: The Great American Fraud heroic medicine patent medicine popular health movement\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-13-tpwky-打垮美国假药狂潮的不是医学进步-而是化学检测/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/360c7ded98e41886-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">57:08</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">This Podcast Will Kill You</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1013</span></div>\n<h2>打垮美國假藥狂潮的不是醫學進步，而是化學檢測</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">19世紀美國假藥靠反精英情緒和報紙廣告做大，真正讓騙局現形的不是細菌學說進步，而是分析化學第一次讓人看清瓶子裡到底裝了什麼。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">醫療史</span><span class=\"tag\">消費者保護</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"parent\" data-hay=\"293: Olympic Mom on How to Keep Club Sports in Check | Lauren Regula play up\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-10-13-asklisa-奥运冠军没让有天赋的女儿进顶级俱乐部-而是选了本地升组/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/0a9bd8840ec139d0-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">49:33</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"parent\"><span class=\"src\">Ask Lisa</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1013</span></div>\n<h2>奧運冠軍沒讓有天賦的女兒進頂級俱樂部，而是選了本地升組</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">她的女兒九歲就被精英教練看中，但一家人沒有報名高強度巡迴隊，而是留在本地俱樂部、讓女兒和大兩三歲的孩子同場訓練比賽，只用兩次訓練就換來同等競技水平。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">青少年體育</span><span class=\"tag\">俱樂部體育</span>\n</div></div></a>"]